20
00:03:48,080 --> 00:03:49,479
You actually got played.

21
00:03:49,479 --> 00:03:50,560
You didn't even realize it!

22
00:03:53,680 --> 00:03:55,560
It must be that bitch, Song Yun.

23
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,000
Give me another chance.

24
00:03:58,680 --> 00:04:00,439
One more chance, and I'll get her.

25
00:04:01,919 --> 00:04:03,639
