167
00:13:00,960 --> 00:13:02,440
You have to smile more.

168
00:13:04,279 --> 00:13:05,559
Even when I'm not here,

169
00:13:06,039 --> 00:13:08,799
you must remain the beautiful, smiling,

170
00:13:08,840 --> 00:13:10,639
and radiant Sister Song.

171
00:13:11,320 --> 00:13:12,120
Okay?

172
00:13:19,080 --> 00:13:19,960
