232
00:17:31,119 --> 00:17:31,920
Second Brother!

233
00:17:32,039 --> 00:17:33,440
What nonsense are you spouting?

234
00:17:34,039 --> 00:17:34,839
Mom!

235
00:17:35,559 --> 00:17:37,240
She ruined my plans!

236
00:17:38,839 --> 00:17:39,640
Alright then.

237
00:17:40,000 --> 00:17:41,839
Let's just tear off this facade.

238
00:17:42,960 --> 00:17:45,079
