241
00:17:49,119 --> 00:17:50,079
Weren't you just after

242
00:17:50,079 --> 00:17:51,720
his title as head of Valley Breeze?

243
00:17:51,839 --> 00:17:52,640
Otherwise,

244
00:17:52,720 --> 00:17:53,640
