287
00:20:30,680 --> 00:20:32,799
I called everyone here today

288
00:20:32,799 --> 00:20:34,960
to announce something important.

289
00:20:35,839 --> 00:20:36,799
Wanmei

290
00:20:36,799 --> 00:20:39,039
is now pregnant with Cheng Feng's child.

291
00:20:39,920 --> 00:20:41,240
For the sake of her health

292
00:20:41,640 --> 00:20:43,920
and the stable development of the company,

293
00:20:44,440 --> 00:20:46,799
I have decided

294
00:20:47,400 --> 00:20:50,359
to suspend all of Lin Wanmei's duties

295
00:20:51,039 --> 00:20:54,000
so she can go home and rest for the baby.

296
00:20:54,640 --> 00:20:55,440
Mom,

297
00:20:56,160 --> 00:20:58,119
I still have a new product to launch.

298
00:20:59,119 --> 00:21:00,599
Don't worry about that.

299
00:21:01,319 --> 00:21:03,160
You don't need to worry about your duties.

300
00:21:03,559 --> 00:21:04,880
Just hand them over to Cheng Yan.

301
00:21:05,400 --> 00:21:07,200
Just focus on taking care of yourself.

302
00:21:07,319 --> 00:21:08,359
I'm fine.

303
00:21:08,599 --> 00:21:10,359
Mom, don't worry about my health.

304
00:21:10,359 --> 00:21:12,839
Mom wants you to rest for your own good.

305
00:21:13,400 --> 00:21:15,000
We won't need you for what comes next.

306
00:21:15,440 --> 00:21:16,240
Got it?

307
00:21:17,799 --> 00:21:19,359
You haven't been to the company recently.

308
00:21:19,839 --> 00:21:21,319
There are situations within the company

309
00:21:21,319 --> 00:21:22,319
that you might not be aware of.

310
00:21:22,480 --> 00:21:23,160
How about

311
00:21:23,160 --> 00:21:26,519
we hear the other shareholders' opinions?

312
00:21:26,519 --> 00:21:27,279
Sure.

313
00:21:27,960 --> 00:21:29,799
You're all veterans of the company.

314
00:21:31,079 --> 00:21:31,880
Old Zhou,

315
00:21:32,400 --> 00:21:33,279
what do you think?

316
00:21:37,200 --> 00:21:38,160
With all due respect,

317
00:21:39,359 --> 00:21:40,880
I disagree with your proposal.

318
00:21:42,519 --> 00:21:42,880
Lin Wanmei

319
00:21:42,880 --> 00:21:44,240
has served the company for many years

320
00:21:44,440 --> 00:21:46,200
and made great contributions.

321
00:21:46,400 --> 00:21:48,759
We've all seen her capabilities.

322
00:21:49,480 --> 00:21:50,759
Just because she is pregnant,

323
00:21:51,000 --> 00:21:52,319
dismissing her from her position

324
00:21:52,519 --> 00:21:53,720
is unfair to her

325
00:21:54,079 --> 00:21:55,640
and detrimental to the company's growth.

326
00:21:55,880 --> 00:21:56,680
Yes.

327
00:21:57,119 --> 00:21:57,920
Old Madam,

328
00:21:58,160 --> 00:22:00,480
Lin Wanmei has led the company's R&D team

329
00:22:00,599 --> 00:22:02,599
and achieved a lot over the years.

330
00:22:02,759 --> 00:22:03,759
If she is dismissed,

331
00:22:03,799 --> 00:22:05,319
the company's business development

332
00:22:05,559 --> 00:22:06,640
will suffer significantly.

333
00:22:14,200 --> 00:22:15,000
Cheng An,

334
00:22:16,400 --> 00:22:17,359
what do you think?

335
00:22:26,759 --> 00:22:27,559
Mr. An,

336
00:22:28,599 --> 00:22:30,480
everyone is waiting for your answer.

337
00:22:31,119 --> 00:22:32,279
The shareholders feel

338
00:22:32,279 --> 00:22:34,039
R&D can't do without Ms. Lin.

339
00:22:34,599 --> 00:22:35,759
What do you think?

340
00:22:36,680 --> 00:22:37,920
I have contacted Kista.

341
00:22:38,440 --> 00:22:40,119
Currently, I'm doing my best

342
00:22:40,119 --> 00:22:41,359
to convince her to join Valley Breeze.

343
00:22:42,559 --> 00:22:44,119
Her industry skills and reputation

344
00:22:44,119 --> 00:22:45,319
are obvious to all.

345
00:22:46,440 --> 00:22:48,119
If she ultimately agrees to join,

346
00:22:48,759 --> 00:22:50,160
I think we can consider

347
00:22:51,279 --> 00:22:52,920
reducing Ms. Lin's workload

348
00:22:53,240 --> 00:22:55,400
so she can focus more on her pregnancy.

349
00:22:55,759 --> 00:22:57,200
At the same time, it can help the company

350
00:22:57,359 --> 00:22:58,720
make better progress.

351
00:23:01,119 --> 00:23:02,599
Mr. An's proposal is great.

352
00:23:02,839 --> 00:23:04,039
If Kista can join us,

353
00:23:04,400 --> 00:23:06,079
then our company's competitiveness

354
00:23:06,319 --> 00:23:07,960
will reach a whole new level.

355
00:23:08,079 --> 00:23:08,640
Yes.

356
00:23:08,640 --> 00:23:09,319
Exactly.

357
00:23:09,720 --> 00:23:10,160
Right.

358
00:23:10,160 --> 00:23:10,599
That's great.

359
00:23:11,680 --> 00:23:12,359
I've heard a lot about her.

360
00:23:12,359 --> 00:23:13,720
She is internationally renowned.

361
00:23:23,960 --> 00:23:24,759
Mom.

362
00:23:25,279 --> 00:23:26,599
Didn't you promise me

363
00:23:26,599 --> 00:23:27,559
that you'd have Lin Wanmei...

364
00:23:27,559 --> 00:23:28,759
Have her go back and rest for the baby?

365
00:23:28,759 --> 00:23:30,559
You said you'd give me all her business.

366
00:23:31,240 --> 00:23:32,119
If you ask me,

367
00:23:32,359 --> 00:23:34,079
you should just send her packing.

368
00:23:34,119 --> 00:23:35,720
Did you forget how she framed me?

369
00:23:37,960 --> 00:23:39,519
Lin Wanmei, Lin Wanmei...

370
00:23:40,240 --> 00:23:41,799
All you can think about is Lin Wanmei.

371
00:23:42,920 --> 00:23:43,839
Can't you see

372
00:23:43,839 --> 00:23:45,480
that there's a much bigger problem?

373
00:23:51,079 --> 00:23:52,640
Those old geezers in the company

374
00:23:53,240 --> 00:23:55,599
used to all follow my lead.

375
00:23:56,200 --> 00:23:57,400
Look at them now.

376
00:23:58,000 --> 00:24:00,039
How many still take me seriously?

377
00:24:01,559 --> 00:24:02,680
If things keep going like this,

378
00:24:03,279 --> 00:24:04,759
Cheng An and Lin Wanmei

379
00:24:05,559 --> 00:24:07,039
will sooner or later take control of

380
00:24:07,640 --> 00:24:09,440
the entire company.

381
00:24:11,079 --> 00:24:11,880
Mom,

382
00:24:13,000 --> 00:24:14,200
I really didn't realize

383
00:24:14,200 --> 00:24:15,240
the problem was this serious.

384
00:24:17,000 --> 00:24:17,799
Mom,

385
00:24:17,960 --> 00:24:19,640
then... then you have to help me.

386
00:24:20,039 --> 00:24:20,759
You said it yourself,

387
00:24:20,759 --> 00:24:22,119
you'd give Valley Breeze Group to me.

388
00:24:22,119 --> 00:24:23,279
From now on,

389
00:24:24,119 --> 00:24:25,480
you need to drop that

390
00:24:25,480 --> 00:24:26,960
slacker attitude of yours

391
00:24:27,119 --> 00:24:29,440
and perform well in the company.

392
00:24:31,480 --> 00:24:32,039
Okay.

393
00:24:32,039 --> 00:24:32,680
Mom,

394
00:24:32,799 --> 00:24:33,599
don't worry.

395
00:24:33,599 --> 00:24:34,359
I will definitely change.

396
00:24:34,359 --> 00:24:35,160
I'll work hard,

397
00:24:35,599 --> 00:24:37,160
and I won't make you worry anymore.

398
00:24:37,680 --> 00:24:38,559
Right now,

399
00:24:39,240 --> 00:24:40,960
we still have a trump card.

400
00:24:42,440 --> 00:24:43,039
You,

401
00:24:43,039 --> 00:24:43,400
me,

402
00:24:43,400 --> 00:24:44,160
and Ruolin

403
00:24:44,759 --> 00:24:47,200
control the most shares in the company.

404
00:24:48,359 --> 00:24:49,759
As long as our shares are intact,

405
00:24:51,160 --> 00:24:52,319
neither Cheng An

406
00:24:52,799 --> 00:24:54,119
nor Lin Wanmei

407
00:24:55,640 --> 00:24:58,599
will be able to make any big waves.

408
00:25:09,160 --> 00:25:10,079
Why are you here?

409
00:25:10,400 --> 00:25:11,119
Cheng An, why did you

410
00:25:11,119 --> 00:25:12,640
team up with Old Madam to suppress me?

411
00:25:13,000 --> 00:25:14,799
Why couldn't you speak up for me?

412
00:25:15,160 --> 00:25:16,359
I don't take sides.

413
00:25:16,920 --> 00:25:18,519
I only act for the good of Valley Breeze.

414
00:25:20,160 --> 00:25:21,359
For the good of Valley Breeze?

415
00:25:21,920 --> 00:25:23,319
You help that outsider, Kista,

416
00:25:23,319 --> 00:25:24,759
to steal my position?

417
00:25:24,799 --> 00:25:26,039
You lack the capability.

418
00:25:26,759 --> 00:25:28,759
You haven't made a decent product in ages.

419
00:25:29,039 --> 00:25:30,559
Kista is far more capable than you.

420
00:25:30,559 --> 00:25:32,039
Choosing her is what's best for Valley Breeze.

421
00:25:32,799 --> 00:25:33,680
Are you done talking?

422
00:25:36,119 --> 00:25:37,480
Do you really hate me that much?

423
00:25:37,759 --> 00:25:39,279
Don't you have any sympathy for me?

424
00:25:44,200 --> 00:25:46,000
And now you're playing the victim?

425
00:25:50,599 --> 00:25:52,039
I love you.

426
00:25:52,279 --> 00:25:53,119
Cheng An.

427
00:25:53,119 --> 00:25:55,279
I just want what I deserve.

428
00:25:55,480 --> 00:25:56,720
Is that wrong?

429
00:25:56,720 --> 00:25:57,519
Lin Wanmei.

430
00:25:58,519 --> 00:25:59,640
Your so-called love

431
00:26:00,279 --> 00:26:02,160
is just you weighing the pros and cons,

432
00:26:02,160 --> 00:26:04,440
then choosing whoever benefits you most.

433
00:26:07,119 --> 00:26:08,559
When I left you back then,

434
00:26:09,000 --> 00:26:10,559
it was also because you weren't capable

435
00:26:10,559 --> 00:26:12,319
to give me the life I wanted.

436
00:26:13,519 --> 00:26:15,640
Isn't it ridiculous for you to say this?

437
00:26:17,440 --> 00:26:18,440
Truly ridiculous.

438
00:26:44,599 --> 00:26:46,000
Cheng An, you bastard!

439
00:26:46,119 --> 00:26:47,680
How could you do this to me?!

440
00:26:55,680 --> 00:26:56,480
Done.

441
00:26:56,920 --> 00:26:59,119
I replied to Cheng An as Kista.

442
00:26:59,799 --> 00:27:02,240
I told him I'm planning to visit China,

443
00:27:02,640 --> 00:27:04,359
and we can discuss it in detail then.

444
00:27:05,200 --> 00:27:06,720
The Cheng family will have their hands full

445
00:27:07,160 --> 00:27:08,160
I bet right now

446
00:27:08,160 --> 00:27:09,680
they're already in complete chaos.

447
00:27:10,599 --> 00:27:11,920
When the time is right,

448
00:27:12,880 --> 00:27:14,480
I'm going to make Lin Wanmei

449
00:27:14,480 --> 00:27:17,680
personally welcome Kista to Valley Breeze.

450
00:27:18,000 --> 00:27:19,039
Hearing you say that,

451
00:27:19,960 --> 00:27:22,079
I can't wait to see that happen.

452
00:27:25,359 --> 00:27:26,240
By the way,

453
00:27:26,920 --> 00:27:28,200
I'm actually really looking forward to

454
00:27:28,519 --> 00:27:29,480
Kista's wine.

455
00:27:30,880 --> 00:27:31,680
Don't worry.

456
00:27:31,720 --> 00:27:32,839
As for Kista's wine,

457
00:27:32,839 --> 00:27:34,440
you'll be the first to taste it.

458
00:27:34,640 --> 00:27:35,720
Consider it a thank-you.

459
00:27:42,839 --> 00:27:44,920
Every bottle of wine I make from now on,

460
00:27:44,920 --> 00:27:46,680
you'll be the first to taste.

461
00:27:58,000 --> 00:27:59,039
Speaking of thanks,

462
00:27:59,359 --> 00:28:00,599
I'm the one who should be thanking you.

463
00:28:01,440 --> 00:28:02,440
If it weren't for you,

464
00:28:02,640 --> 00:28:04,440
I'd never have entered the market so fast.

465
00:28:06,640 --> 00:28:07,880
Technically, this club

466
00:28:08,279 --> 00:28:09,319
is half yours.

467
00:28:10,880 --> 00:28:11,920
Since you won't accept it,

468
00:28:13,000 --> 00:28:14,400
I'll just have to put in extra work.
